A `[RequireComponent(typeof(LineRenderer))]` class that draws a Catmull-Rom spline between two port anchors with three on-curve handles (20%/50%/80%).

**How p0/p2 are set:** `p0` and `p2` are `public Transform` fields (the two endpoint port anchors). They are NOT set internally — they are assigned externally by `TubeBuilderManager.CreateTube()`:
```csharp
