**Spawn logic (UseItem):** Checks `itemnum <= 0 || !ItemManager.Instance.inventory.ContainsKey(this.itemins)` → warns and returns. Calls `ClearAndReturnCurrentPlacement()` to cancel any in-progress placement. Instantiates `_gridObjectToSpawnPrefab` at the grid position, ensures an `Item3D` component exists, links `itemUI = this` and `itemSelf = this.itemins` onto the spawned `Item3D`, fires `OnOptionSelected`, and enters placement mode:
```csharp
objectToPlace = Instantiate(_gridObjectToSpawnPrefab, GridManagerAccessor.GridManager.GetGridPosition(), Quaternion.identity);
objectToPlace.name = _gridObjectToSpawnPrefab.name;
if (!objectToPlace.TryGetComponent(out Item3D gridObject)) objectToPlace.AddComponent<Item3D>();
objectToPlace.GetComponent<Item3D>().itemUI = this;
objectToPlace.GetComponent<Item3D>().itemSelf = this.itemins;
OnOptionSelected?.Invoke(objectToPlace);
GridManagerAccessor.GridManager.EnterPlacementMode(objectToPlace);
```

**itemnum/chazhi counters:** Subscribes to `GridControlManager_sample.OnObjectPlacedOnGrid`. When a placed object's `Item3D.itemUI == this` and `!hasCreate`, it sets `hasCreate=true`, then decrements:
```csharp
itemnum--;
chazhi++;
UpdateUIState();
```
`UpdateUIState()` (called every `Update`) sets `numText.text = itemnum.ToString()` and `btn.interactable = (itemnum > 0)`. So `itemnum` = available count, `chazhi` = cumulative placed count (used in `Init` to subtract already-placed items from a reloaded total: `itemnum = num - chazhi`). Button starts non-interactable (`btn.interactable=false` in Start).

